{"seq":3,"slug":"generics-concepts","title":"泛型与概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-systems-language/metaprogramming/generics-concepts","wordCount":1241,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"泛型与概念\">泛型与概念</h1><p>模板和宏改写代码的形状，泛型则约束代码的类型。一个 <code>proc sort[T]</code> 对任意可比较的 <code>T</code> 工作，但「可比较」这个要求怎么表达、怎么让编译器在实例化前就检查？Nim 用 <code>concept</code> 回答了这个问题——它是 Nim 版的「带名字的类型约束」，让泛型从「鸭子类型式的乐观展开」升级为「有契约的参数化多态」。本篇把泛型、concept、static[T] 串成一条从无约束到有约束、再到值进入类型层的完整链路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从参数化类型到约束类型\">核心概念：从参数化类型到约束类型</h2><p>泛型的起点很朴素：把类型当参数。<code>seq[T]</code>、<code>Table[K, V]</code> 都是泛型类型，<code>proc map[T, U](s: seq[T], f: proc(x: T): U): seq[U]</code> 是泛型过程。但裸泛型有个问题——它对 <code>T</code> 一无所知，只能在实例化时「试着展开」，类型不匹配的错误往往晦涩。concept 给 <code>T</code> 加上结构契约，把错误提前、把意图写明。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[需要对多种类型工作] --&gt; B[泛型 T&lt;br/&gt;参数化类型]&#10;    B --&gt; C{需要约束 T 的能力?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[裸泛型&lt;br/&gt;实例化时检查]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[concept&lt;br/&gt;结构化类型约束]&#10;    E --&gt; F[实例化前验证契约]&#10;    A --&gt; G{需要把值带进类型?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[static T&lt;br/&gt;值即类型参数]&#10;    H --&gt; I[编译期数组大小 / 维度]\">flowchart TD\n    A[需要对多种类型工作] --&gt; B[泛型 T&lt;br/&gt;参数化类型]\n    B --&gt; C{需要约束 T 的能力?}\n    C --&gt;|否| D[裸泛型&lt;br/&gt;实例化时检查]\n    C --&gt;|是| E[concept&lt;br/&gt;结构化类型约束]\n    E --&gt; F[实例化前验证契约]\n    A --&gt; G{需要把值带进类型?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[static T&lt;br/&gt;值即类型参数]\n    H --&gt; I[编译期数组大小 / 维度]</pre><p>下表区分这三种参数化手段，它们解决的是不同维度的问题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>参数是</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>检查时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>泛型 <code>[T]</code></td>\n<td>类型</td>\n<td>一份代码服务多类型</td>\n<td>实例化时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>concept</td>\n<td>类型需满足的约束</td>\n<td>给泛型加可读契约</td>\n<td>实例化前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>static[T]</code></td>\n<td>编译期已知的值</td>\n<td>把值提升到类型层</td>\n<td>编译期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套类型层能力，建立在 <a href=\"../foundations/syntax-types\">语法与类型系统</a> 的类型推断之上，又常与 <a href=\"macros-ast\">宏与 AST</a> 配合——宏内省类型、泛型参数化类型，两者是元编程的左右手。</p>\n<h2 id=\"裸泛型-一份代码-多种类型\">裸泛型：一份代码，多种类型</h2><p>泛型最直接的价值是消除「为每种类型重写一遍」的重复。Nim 的泛型是真正的单态化（monomorphization）——编译器为每个实际用到的类型生成专门的特化代码，因此泛型没有运行时分发开销，性能等同手写。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"proc swap[T](a, b: var T) =&#10;  let tmp = a&#10;  a = b&#10;  b = tmp&#10;&#10;var x, y = 0&#10;(x, y) = (1, 2)&#10;swap(x, y)          # T = int，编译期特化&#10;&#10;var s, t = &quot;&quot;&#10;swap(s, t)          # T = string，另一份特化\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>proc swap[T](a, b: var T) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let tmp = a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  a = b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  b = tmp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>var x, y = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(x, y) = (1, 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>swap(x, y)          # T = int，编译期特化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>var s, t = \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>swap(s, t)          # T = string，另一份特化</span></span></code></pre></div><p>单态化是 Nim 泛型性能的关键，也是它与 Java/C# 那种类型擦除式泛型的根本区别。代价是代码体积可能膨胀，但换来零成本——这与 <a href=\"../foundations/nim-philosophy\">设计哲学</a> 里「抽象不应有运行时税」的立场一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"concept-给类型参数立契约\">concept：给类型参数立契约</h2><p>裸泛型的痛点是「错得晚、错得乱」。当你写 <code>proc sum[T](xs: seq[T])</code> 并在体内用 <code>+</code>，若有人传了不支持 <code>+</code> 的类型，错误会在展开深处爆出。concept 让你把要求写在签名上：T 必须支持哪些操作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"type Addable = concept x, y&#10;  (x + y) is type(x)   # 必须支持同类型相加&#10;&#10;proc sumAll[T: Addable](xs: seq[T]): T =&#10;  result = xs[0]&#10;  for i in 1 ..&lt; xs.len: result = result + xs[i]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type Addable = concept x, y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (x + y) is type(x)   # 必须支持同类型相加</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc sumAll[T: Addable](xs: seq[T]): T =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result = xs[0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for i in 1 ..&#x3C; xs.len: result = result + xs[i]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>concept</code> 用一组「样例表达式必须类型检查通过」来定义约束。<code>T: Addable</code> 把契约钉在泛型参数上，编译器在实例化前就验证候选类型是否满足，错误信息直接指向「类型不满足 Addable」而非展开内部。这让泛型库的 API 既自文档化又对调用者友好。concept 在 Nim 2.x 中仍标注为实验特性，语法在演进中，生产使用时建议锁定编译器版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"static-t-把值搬进类型层\">static[T]：把值搬进类型层</h2><p>有时你想把一个编译期已知的值当作类型的一部分——比如固定长度向量的维度、编译期配置开关。<code>static[T]</code> 让一个值成为类型参数，参与编译期计算与重载分发。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"type Vector[N: static[int]] = object&#10;  data: array[N, float]&#10;&#10;proc dot[N: static[int]](a, b: Vector[N]): float =&#10;  for i in 0 ..&lt; N: result += a.data[i] * b.data[i]&#10;&#10;var v: Vector[3]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type Vector[N: static[int]] = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data: array[N, float]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc dot[N: static[int]](a, b: Vector[N]): float =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for i in 0 ..&#x3C; N: result += a.data[i] * b.data[i]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>var v: Vector[3]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里 <code>N</code> 是一个编译期整数，<code>Vector[3]</code> 与 <code>Vector[4]</code> 是不同类型，编译器据此分配定长数组、展开循环。数学上，这把维度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 从运行时变量提升为类型层常量，使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{a} \\cdot \\vec{b} = \\sum_{i=0}^{N-1} a_i b_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9774em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9774em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2809em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的循环边界在编译期就确定，便于优化器展开。<code>static[T]</code> 与 <a href=\"../foundations/nim-philosophy\">设计哲学</a> 里的编译期 VM 是同一思路的延伸：能在编译期定的，就别留到运行时。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组合威力-泛型-concept-宏\">组合威力：泛型 + concept + 宏</h2><p>三种工具单独有用，组合起来才显出 Nim 元编程的全貌。一个典型的高阶库会这样分工：泛型提供类型参数化，concept 约束这些参数的能力，宏在编译期根据具体类型生成特化逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"type Serializable = concept x&#10;  x.toBytes() is seq[byte]&#10;&#10;proc store[T: Serializable](x: T) =&#10;  let bytes = x.toBytes()&#10;  # ... 写入存储\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type Serializable = concept x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  x.toBytes() is seq[byte]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc store[T: Serializable](x: T) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let bytes = x.toBytes()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # ... 写入存储</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种组合让库既通用（泛型）、又安全（concept 拒绝不合规类型）、还高效（宏生成的 toBytes 是零成本的）。它正是 Nim 标准库与 Status 等公司的高性能库的共同骨架。当这些抽象需要落到真实性能数字时，如何确认它们没有引入隐藏开销，见 <a href=\"../ecosystem/performance\">性能优化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>泛型把类型当参数，Nim 用单态化生成特化代码，性能等同手写、无运行时分发开销。</li>\n<li>裸泛型「错得晚」，concept 用结构化契约把约束写进签名，实例化前验证、报错精确（仍为实验特性，建议锁版本）。</li>\n<li><code>static[T]</code> 把编译期已知的值提升到类型层，用于定长数组、维度等，延续编译期计算的思路。</li>\n<li>三种参数化手段解决不同维度问题：类型用泛型、约束用 concept、值用 static。</li>\n<li>泛型 + concept + 宏的组合是 Nim 高性能库的共同骨架：通用、安全、零成本三者兼得。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"泛型与概念","id":"泛型与概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从参数化类型到约束类型","id":"核心概念-从参数化类型到约束类型"},{"level":2,"text":"裸泛型：一份代码，多种类型","id":"裸泛型-一份代码-多种类型"},{"level":2,"text":"concept：给类型参数立契约","id":"concept-给类型参数立契约"},{"level":2,"text":"static[T]：把值搬进类型层","id":"static-t-把值搬进类型层"},{"level":2,"text":"组合威力：泛型 + concept + 宏","id":"组合威力-泛型-concept-宏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"宏与 AST","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-systems-language/metaprogramming/macros-ast"},"next":{"title":"编译后端 C 与 JS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-systems-language/systems/compile-backends"}}